    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in presenting this absolutely fantastic two-bedroom own door ground floor apartment to the market within the prestigious Carrigmore development, Citywest. The phrase 'location, location, location' immediately springs to mind as this magnificent development is ideally positioned less than five minutes' walk from the Luas and also within a mere stone's throw you will find the Citywest Shopping Centre, choice of bus routes giving easy access to the City Centre and a host of major road networks.\r\n\r\nBright, airy and most elegant internal living accommodation of c. 70 sqm comprises of entrance hallway, modern fully fitted kitchen, extra-large open plan living/dining area, internal hallway with two double bedrooms (both with built in wardrobes) and main family bathroom. A door from the living room and main bedroom lead onto private patio areas with low maintenance, the rear is a highly sought after south facing orientation making it perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings whilst the front provides ample parking on a peaceful cul de sac. \r\n\r\nNo. 8 comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years, it has been fully renovated from top to bottom with fresh painting, new windows & doors and lovely new fitted kitchen. These own door apartments are exceptionally spacious and offer a lengthy list of striking features such as double-glazed windows, gas fired central heating, ample parking and sunny south facing patio area to name but a few. Mixed interest is sure to be seen from a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get on the property ladder, investors looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area and people looking to downsize. \r\nRegister your interest today with Ray Cooke Auctioneers. \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 70 sqm \r\n- BER C\r\n- Management fees c. 1,162 per annum \r\n- 2 bed 1 bath \r\n- Ground floor apartment \r\n- Own door apartment \r\n- Superbly maintained \r\n- Great condition throughout\r\n- Tastefully decorated \r\n- Fully renovated in recent years \r\n- New windows & doors \r\n- Double glazed & PVC\r\n- New fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Entrance hallway \r\n- Large open plan living/dining area \r\n- Fully fitted modern kitchen\r\n- Internal hallway \r\n- Two double bedrooms \r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Main family bathroom \r\n- Two private patio areas \r\n- Sunny south facing to the rear \r\n- Top quality flooring throughout \r\n- Overlooking courtyard to rear \r\n- Ample parking \r\n- Overground and underground parking \r\n- Located on highly sought-after road\r\n- Located on peaceful cul de sac \r\n- Luas stop within 5 minutes' walk \r\n- Citywest shopping centre on your doorstep \r\n- M50 & N7 within easy reach \r\n- Viewing highly advised \r\n\r\nDirections - From the Naas Road take Exit 3 for Citywest. At the roundabout at the top of the slip road turn right. Proceed straight ahead until you reach the City West Shopping Centre and at this roundabout continue along and turn left onto Carrigmore Elms and proceed straight ahead then turn right onto Carrigmore Manor then right again onto Carrigmore Terrace where number 8 will be on the right."
      },
